---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Troubleshooting">
  <h1>Troubleshooting</h1>
  <p>For each issue, record the exact warning text, symptoms, conditions when it occurs, recent work, diagnostic trouble codes, and any relevant software version.</p>
  <h2>Suggested diagnostic approach</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Identify whether the issue affects safe operation. Stop driving if necessary.</li>
    <li>Record the warning message exactly as displayed.</li>
    <li>Check the owner's manual for the warning's meaning and required action.</li>
    <li>Scan for diagnostic codes using equipment compatible with the vehicle.</li>
    <li>Verify likely causes before replacing parts.</li>
  </ol>
</BaseLayout>
